url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22234711"
abstract: >-
  Thirty transient saturated pool-boiling experiments with deionized water on
  flat copper, straight-microchannel copper, and square-micropillar copper
  surfaces at nominal vapor-space pressures from 10 to 100 kPa. The archive
  contains native and processed thermal and pressure records, side-view video,
  and selected image-derived quantities.
